scale = 1
fontscale = 1.15
color = 0x183C43
RA: box "ResearchActivity" bold "logbook: Option<Logbook>" wid 1.9in ht 0.75in rad 0.08in fill 0xF3F0FF thickness 0
L: box "Logbook" bold "summary? · range?" "entries: Vec<LogbookEntry>" wid 2.1in ht 0.9in rad 0.08in fill 0xE7F3E9 thickness 0 at RA+(2.35in,0)
E: box "LogbookEntry" bold "untagged enum" "Activity | StatusUpdate" wid 2.1in ht 0.9in rad 0.08in fill 0xFFF4D6 thickness 0 at L+(2.4in,0)
A: box "ActivityEntry" bold "identifier · projectId · timestamp" "category · state · summary" "global · origin · archived · optional detail" wid 2.8in ht 1.05in rad 0.08in fill 0xE8F1FB thickness 0 at L+(-0.55in,-1.65in)
S: box "StatusUpdateEntry" bold "identifier · projectId · timestamp" "summary · significance · health" "range? · evidence? · risk?" wid 2.8in ht 1.05in rad 0.08in fill 0xE8F1FB thickness 0 at E+(0,-1.65in)
AD: box "Activity detail" bold "classification? · eventType? · items?" "discovery?: provider · source · discoveredAt" wid 2.8in ht 0.9in rad 0.08in fill 0xF3F0FF thickness 0 at A+(0,-1.45in)
SD: box "Status detail" bold "ReportingWindow: left? · right" "ProjectHealth: status · reason?" "ProjectRisk: kind · explanation" wid 2.8in ht 1.0in rad 0.08in fill 0xFFF4D6 thickness 0 at S+(0,-1.45in)
arrow from RA.e to L.w thick color 0x00662C
arrow from L.e to E.w thick color 0x00662C
Branch: line from E.s down 0.35in color 0x00662C
line from Branch.end to (A.x,Branch.end.y) color 0x00662C
arrow from (A.x,Branch.end.y) to A.n thick color 0x00662C
line from Branch.end to (S.x,Branch.end.y) color 0x00662C
arrow from (S.x,Branch.end.y) to S.n thick color 0x00662C
arrow from A.s to AD.n thick color 0x506A70
arrow from S.s to SD.n thick color 0x506A70
